#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This run is from the CPAR archive CarSim_Kinematical_Preview.cpar.
#
#This example shows ABS braking behavior on a split-mu surface. This particular run is made to compare different options for numerical integration and linking with Simulink. Outputs are written every time step (2000 Hz). The run is stopped after 1.5s because the behavior of interest can be seen the the plot of actuator pressure for one wheel.
#
#This specific run uses the built-in ABS controller.
#
#Plots overlaid with a reference with a very short time step shows close agreement.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

